{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114094","id":3108234671,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc65Q-Wv","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114094","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114094.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114094.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114094","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114094/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114094/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114094/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2eaa3f09bc3e43b04b6a00afbfea487a560c28e3","number":114094,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix bad handling of buffer over and underruns in `AudioStreamPlaybackMicrophone`","user":{"login":"directrix1","id":474780,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NDc4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/474780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/directrix1","html_url":"https://github.com/directrix1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/directrix1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/directrix1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/directrix1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/directrix1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/directrix1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/directrix1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/directrix1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/directrix1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/directrix1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Microphone input can drift in how many samples are available at any one time, losing synchronization with the output bus. When this happens, the current code starts looping a distorted mess as the playback crosses the threshold for where new samples are placed in the buffer. This fix effectively guarantees that despite this drift, decent audio will be returned. It handles these two use cases:\r\n\r\n1. buffer underrun (microphone audio is played back quicker than is available) this jumps the current playback position in the buffer back by the input delay. \r\n2. buffer overrun (microphone audio is played back slower than is available) this jumps the current playback position in the buffer forward by the input delay. \r\n\r\nAssuming constant drift it should average out to the expected input delay.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com